{"id": 62985, "date": "2025-12-11T04:00:05", "date_gmt": "2025-12-11T12:00:05", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=62985"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T19:03:07", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T02:03:07", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-11-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/11/kingdom-of-days-december-11-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 11"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1971:\u00a0</strong>The Bruce Springsteen Band is in residence at the Student Prince in Asbury Park.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23211\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1971-12-10/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?fit=1164%2C1402&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1164,1402\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1971-12-10\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?fit=758%2C913&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23211 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=758%2C913&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"913\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?w=1164&amp;ssl=1 1164w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=249%2C300&amp;ssl=1 249w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=850%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 850w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=768%2C925&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band make a Born to Run Tour stop at Seton Hall University, where they play &#8220;Party Lights&#8221; for the last time to date.</p>\n<div id=\"v-32Ky6u31-1\" class=\"video-player\"><iframe title='VideoPress Video Player' aria-label='VideoPress Video Player' width='758' height='426' src='https://videopress.com/embed/32Ky6u31?hd=1&amp;cover=1&amp;loop=0&amp;autoPlay=0&amp;permalink=1&amp;muted=0&amp;controls=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;useAverageColor=0&amp;preloadContent=metadata' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen data-resize-to-parent=\"true\" allow='clipboard-write; presentation'></iframe></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KT8lMzs559M?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"46887\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/newsday__nassau_edition__sun__dec_28__1975_/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C652&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2560,652\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?fit=758%2C193&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-46887 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?resize=758%2C193&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"193\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?resize=300%2C76&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?resize=1024%2C261&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?resize=768%2C195&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?resize=1536%2C391&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?resize=2048%2C521&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Newsday__Nassau_Edition__Sun__Dec_28__1975_-scaled.jpg?w=2274&amp;ssl=1 2274w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1980:\u00a0</strong>The original River Tour stops at the Civic Center in Providence, Rhode Island. The show